flowchart TD
    Start([Start: UploadDocument]) --> Input[/Input: student_id, query_id, file_obj/]
    Input --> CheckSize{file_obj.size > 25MB?}
    
    CheckSize -- Yes --> Err1[/Return Error: Size limit exceeded/]
    CheckSize -- No --> CheckFormat{Format supported?}
    
    CheckFormat -- No --> Err2[/Return Error: Unsupported format/]
    CheckFormat -- Yes --> QQuery[(Query D3: QUERIES)]
    
    QQuery --> CheckQuery{query found?}
    CheckQuery -- No --> Err3[/Return Error: Invalid query/]
    
    CheckQuery -- Yes --> S3[Call AWSS3_Upload]
    S3 --> InitDoc[Initialize doc_record]
    InitDoc --> InsertDoc[(Insert into D4: DOCUMENTS)]
    InsertDoc --> UpdateQuery[Update parent_query.status]
    UpdateQuery --> UpdateDB[(Update D3: QUERIES)]
    UpdateDB --> AsyncNotif[Call DispatchNotificationAsync: Staff]
    AsyncNotif --> Output[/Return Success: document_id/]
    
    Output --> End([End])
    Err1 --> End
    Err2 --> End
    Err3 --> End